### Acceptance & Risk

Mollie's acceptance and risk product helps merchants maximise legitimate payment conversions while automatically detecting and preventing fraudulent transactions. It operates in the background of the payment flow, applying risk logic without creating friction for genuine customers.

How it works

Mollie applies fraud detection and risk monitoring across every transaction processed through its platform. Machine learning models assess transaction signals in real time, flagging or blocking suspicious activity before it results in a chargeback or financial loss. Merchants can configure risk rules and thresholds where appropriate, and monitor risk exposure directly in the Mollie Dashboard.

Product features and USPs

Fraud detection — real-time transaction scoring using machine learning to identify suspicious patterns before payment is authorised
Fraud prevention — automated blocking and flagging of high-risk transactions, reducing chargebacks and financial exposure without manual review overhead
Risk monitoring — ongoing visibility into risk metrics, flagged transactions, and chargeback rates from within the Mollie Dashboard
Optimised acceptance rates — risk logic is tuned to minimise false positives, avoiding unnecessary declines of legitimate customers
No additional integration required — risk and fraud tooling is embedded within Mollie's core payment processing; no separate vendor or API needed
Chargeback management support — tooling to help merchants respond to and contest chargebacks where appropriate

Who it is for

Acceptance and risk tooling is relevant to any merchant processing online payments through Mollie, but is particularly valuable for e-commerce businesses in higher-risk verticals, merchants with high average order values, and platforms managing payments on behalf of multiple sub-merchants.

