Merchants based in the Netherlands can open a Mollie Business Account from within the Mollie Dashboard for €9/month, with the first 12 months free. Once active, payment revenue settles directly into the Business Account, with payouts available every day of the year including weekends and public holidays. Merchants can create multiple accounts each with their own Dutch IBAN, issue Mollie Cards to themselves and their team, pay suppliers via bank transfer or Direct Debit, and connect to accounting software — all without leaving Mollie.

