Free incoming transactions — no fees on incoming payments or transfers
100 free outgoing transactions per month included in the base plan
Pay from one place — settle one-off bills via bank transfer, set up recurring costs via Direct Debit, and shop online with iDEAL or Wero, all directly from the Business Account
Automated bookkeeping — integrates with 17 accounting tools including Exact, Twinfield, SnelStart, and Moneybird; transactions sync automatically in real time
Consolidated financial view — payment processing activity and business account balances visible in the same Mollie Dashboard
Human customer support — 24/7 support from real people
