### Cross-Border Currency & FX Handling

Mollie supports cross-border transactions and payments with multi-currency capabilities, allowing merchants to accept and settle payments in various currencies. 

Key features include:

- Support for major global currencies and local currencies in supported markets.
- Multi-currency invoicing and reporting to simplify accounting and reconciliation.

Mollie supports multi-currency payment acceptance. FX handling and settlement currency options are configured at the account level. For current rates, supported currencies, and fee structure, contact Mollie directly. A dedicated public page for this topic is not currently available.

