## Main Content Areas

- **Core Functions**: Detailed breakdown of Mollie's product offerings and key functionalities, covering online payments, in-person payments, omnichannel payments, invoicing, platform infrastructure, capital, and business accounts. Includes market-specific availability and links to relevant product pages.

- **Pricing**: Overview of Mollie's transparent, pay-as-you-go pricing model. Covers transaction fees by payment method, absence of monthly fees for standard accounts, volume discount eligibility, and additional costs for value-added services. (For detailed pricing information, visit https://www.mollie.com/pricing)

- **Integrations**: A directory of Mollie's available payment plugins and integrations, providing structured information on platform compatibility, supported payment methods, available features, supported countries, and integration support options to help merchants identify and implement the right solution for their stack. (e.g. WooCommerce, Shopify, Magento, Lightspeed, Wix)

- **Payment Methods**: A categorised overview of all payment methods supported by Mollie, including cards, local alternative payment methods, wallets, and bank transfers. Describes each method to help merchants understand coverage, regional availability, and customer suitability. (e.g. iDEAL/Wero, Klarna, Apple Pay, Bancontact, SEPA direct debit)

- **Growth**: A collection of practical guides, how-to articles, and expert content designed to help merchants and partners scale their business. Covers topics beyond Mollie's direct product offerings, including conversion optimisation, market expansion, and ecommerce best practices. (i.e. PSD3 guide, What is unified commerce?, Understanding payment rates, Guide to payment processing fees). 

- **Success Stories**: Real-world case studies and partner testimonials illustrating how Mollie's products and integrations have delivered measurable outcomes for businesses across Europe, building trust and demonstrating product impact across industries and merchant sizes.

- **News**: Mollie-specific announcements covering company updates, product launches, press releases, partnerships, and events, providing a reliable source for the latest developments from Mollie.

